- Added `interact_equipable_predicates` field to slot defition:
  - Allows to define whatever an item can be put into slot when using it in hand.
- Used a new `LivingEntity#getTrinkets()` method via interface injection:
  - Allows to quickly get the attachment from the entity.
- Deprecated old TrinketsApi#getEntitySlots/getPlayerSlots methods:
  - SlotGroup#getEntityGroups / getPlayerGroups can be used as a replacement.
- Deprecated SlotGroup#slots:
  - SlotGroups#getSlots can be used as a replaced, if you only care about slots.
  - SlotType#getEntitySlots can be used to get the string id -> SlotType map, based on full ids.
- Fixed the trinkets command.
- Fixed trinkets not being equipable by default.
- Fixed creative crash when changing Trinket slot count.